flf2a$ 6 5 28 -1 8 0 0 11
dots-mixed: original Dots line lettering, 2026.
Based on the Dots logo and the user-designed replacement D.
Distinct upper/lowercase; row 6 holds descenders.
UTF-8 artwork. Use a Unicode-capable FIGlet build and terminal.
Example: figlet -C utf8 -f dots-mixed "25°C"
Full-width layout by default; one blank column separates glyphs.
Includes printable ASCII, German required slots, and extra symbols.
Extras: degree, plus/minus, times, divide, arrows, check, infinity.
